## Repo map

Where to look, so as not to explore: read it before opening files, and update it in the commit
that adds, moves or removes a directory, a domain or an entry point. One line per place, what
it holds; no copy of the code.

{% if backend == 'django' -%}
- `backend/config/`: settings (`settings.py`), URLs (`urls.py`), Ninja API (`api.py`),
  middlewares, health probes (`health.py`), admin commands (`management/`).
- `backend/<app>/`: one Django app per business domain; `backend/tests/`: cross-cutting tests.
{% elif backend == 'fastapi' -%}
- `backend/app/`: entry point (`main.py`), settings (`settings.py`), health probes
  (`health.py`); one module per domain. `backend/tests/`: tests.
{% elif backend == 'data' -%}
- `backend/pipeline/`: loading (`sources.py`), transformations (`transforms.py`), figures
  (`figures.py`); `backend/notebooks/`: marimo notebooks; `backend/data/`: data (`sample/` is
  committed). `backend/tests/`: tests.
{% elif backend == 'cli' -%}
- `backend/{{ name | replace('-', '_') }}/`: commands (`cli.py`, entry point `__main__.py`) and
  business logic; `backend/tests/`: tests.
{% elif backend == 'java' -%}
- `backend/src/main/java/{{ java_package | replace('.', '/') }}/`: entry point (`Main.java`), one
  package per domain; `backend/src/test/java/`: JUnit tests; `backend/pom.xml`: Maven build.
{% endif -%}
{% if frontend == 'nuxt' -%}
- `frontend/app/`: pages, components (`components/`), composables, styles (`assets/`),
  constants (`app/utils/constants.ts`){% if backend == 'django' %}, API types generated in
  `app/types/api.d.ts`{% endif %}.
{% elif frontend == 'next' -%}
- `frontend/app/`: routes (App Router); `frontend/components/`: components; `frontend/lib/`:
  API client and constants (`constants.ts`).
{% elif frontend == 'astro' -%}
- `frontend/src/`: pages (`pages/`), layouts (`layouts/`), styles, constants (`constants.ts`).
{% elif frontend == 'vite-react' -%}
- `frontend/src/`: the app (`App.tsx`, entry `main.tsx`), API client (`lib/`), constants
  (`constants.ts`); `frontend/index.html`: the page Vite serves.
{% elif frontend in ['streamlit', 'dash'] -%}
- `frontend/app.py`: entry point; `frontend/dashboard/`: pages, layout and constants;
  `frontend/tests/`: tests.
{% endif -%}
{% if deploy == 'vps' -%}
- `config/vps/`, `scripts/ops/`: deployment and operations; how-to in
  [`docs/operations/production.md`](docs/operations/production.md).
{% endif -%}
- `docs/backlog/`: the work to do; `charter.toml`: the checked rules; `.claude/rules/kiln/`:
  kiln's rules for Claude.

